{"id":"pobreza","lemma":"pobreza","pos":"noun","rank":3594,"glosses":["poverty"],"ipa":"/poˈbɾeθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pobrezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-pobreza.wav","examples":[{"text":"La pobreza lo hizo robar.","en":"Poverty drove him to steal.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to rob"}]},{"text":"Él atribuye su pobreza a la mala suerte.","en":"He attributes his poverty to bad luck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689274","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to assign","l":"atribuir"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"bad luck"]]},{"text":"La pobreza es la raíz de todo mal.","en":"Poverty is the root of all evil.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"root"},null,null,{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"all kinds of things"]]},{"text":"La pobreza no es una deshonra.","en":"There's no shame in being poor.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dishonor"}]},{"text":"Tom creció en la pobreza.","en":"Tom grew up in poverty.","words":[null,{"g":"to grow","l":"crecer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}